WEBVTT


00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.946
What are you so scared of?


00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.917
If you move, you'll
get stabbed in the face.


00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:03.825
P-Please stop this!


00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:07.030
Dumb-ass. Stop crying.


00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:12.163
As punishment, we'll all
throw our knives at once.


00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:15.931
Ready, set...


00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:17.565
Cut that out!


00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:27.778
What if that kid gets
stabbed by your knives?


00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.187
Who are you?


00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.324
This is none of your business.


00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:40.326
Unfortunately, it is my business.


00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:44.832
You remember, don't you?


00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:48.202
Yu Hyuga. My little brother.


00:01:49.374 --> 00:01:51.842
You bullied him to death.


00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.941
I have no idea who that is.


00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:57.339
Oh, really?


00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:03.047
Even if you don't remember him,
he's waiting for you in hell!


00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:07.283
I'm gonna kill you!


00:02:33.952 --> 00:02:37.945
Stop screaming so pathetically.
You're a man, aren't you?


00:02:38.991 --> 00:02:41.585
You won't die from
getting your hand cut off.


00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:43.425
After all...


00:02:44.062 --> 00:02:46.428
I only have one arm too!


00:03:14.993 --> 00:03:18.156
I'll blast you to pieces!


00:03:26.405 --> 00:03:29.033
That thing is real! No fair!


00:03:29.241 --> 00:03:30.606
So what?


00:04:19.558 --> 00:04:20.525
Hey!


00:05:27.292 --> 00:05:29.522
Are you okay?


00:05:30.996 --> 00:05:32.861
You're safe now.


00:05:33.332 --> 00:05:35.926
Murderer... Murderer...


00:05:36.068 --> 00:05:38.002
Murderer!


00:05:40.872 --> 00:05:44.205
That's right. I am a murderer.


00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:50.072
But until a half year ago, I was
a normal high schooler who was able


00:05:50.182 --> 00:05:53.310
to hold her little
brother with her left arm.


00:05:56.455 --> 00:05:57.979
Here we go, Yoshie.


00:05:58.323 --> 00:05:59.558
<i>Six Months Ago
All right!</i>


00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:00.258
<i>Six Months Ago</i>


00:06:00.258 --> 00:06:02.283
<i>Six Months Ago
Wait up!</i>


00:06:04.363 --> 00:06:06.092
Wait, Ami!


00:06:07.966 --> 00:06:09.433
Wait! Wait!


00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:14.696
Nice shot! You're amazing, Ami!


00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.173
You're really something. So cool.


00:06:18.443 --> 00:06:21.742
If you were a boy,
I might have fallen for you.


00:06:21.847 --> 00:06:23.144
Stop it.


00:06:23.248 --> 00:06:26.479
I don't want a girl
to have a crush on me.


00:06:27.886 --> 00:06:31.083
But it looks like
it's not that way after all.


00:06:31.156 --> 00:06:32.123
How so?


00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:35.853
Because it looks
like you have a young fan.


00:06:35.994 --> 00:06:37.757
You're so popular!


00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:40.331
And he's so cute. I'm jealous.


00:06:41.066 --> 00:06:43.864
Dummy. That's my little brother, Yu.


00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:58.613
I'm impressed, Sis. I had no idea
you were so good at basketball.


00:06:58.717 --> 00:07:01.083
You're always lying around the house.


00:07:01.186 --> 00:07:02.380
Quiet, you.


00:07:03.588 --> 00:07:06.284
So why'd you stop by today?


00:07:07.092 --> 00:07:11.893
There's always something going on
when you come visit me like that.


00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:16.126
I'll pay you back, so please lend
me money to buy a new game!


00:07:16.768 --> 00:07:18.201
I knew it.


00:07:18.537 --> 00:07:19.595
No way.


00:07:20.071 --> 00:07:23.040
We don't have that
kind of money to spend.


00:07:23.141 --> 00:07:25.701
Sis, please. I really want it.


00:07:25.811 --> 00:07:29.042
I'll clean up every day,
even wash the dishes.


00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.643
Sis. Come on, Sis.


00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.517
Really?


00:07:47.399 --> 00:07:48.525
Yu.


00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.830
Takeshi, how much did you bring?


00:07:52.904 --> 00:07:55.566
I took 10,000 yen from my mom.


00:07:55.674 --> 00:07:57.938
I see. Me too.


00:07:59.311 --> 00:08:01.575
They're not gonna be happy.


00:08:20.332 --> 00:08:22.527
Hello, it's Yu.


00:08:22.667 --> 00:08:23.998
It's Takeshi.


00:08:24.102 --> 00:08:25.933
Excuse us.


00:08:27.606 --> 00:08:29.005
You're late.


00:08:29.107 --> 00:08:30.540
I'm sorry.


00:08:39.918 --> 00:08:41.385
Where's the money?


00:08:42.387 --> 00:08:45.015
Hurry up and hand it over.


00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:50.352
This isn't even half
of what we agreed on.


00:08:51.663 --> 00:08:52.960
Hey!


00:08:55.166 --> 00:08:56.428
Hey, Yu...


00:08:57.903 --> 00:09:00.133
How'd you get that money?


00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.138
I borrowed it from my sister.


00:09:09.781 --> 00:09:14.514
Then I expect you to get
more by tomorrow. 200,000 yen.


00:09:16.254 --> 00:09:21.351
If you can't, then I'll make your sister
work at my dad's whorehouse.


00:09:21.493 --> 00:09:23.927
She has nothing to do with this!


00:09:24.629 --> 00:09:27.359
Who do you think you are?


00:09:32.437 --> 00:09:34.268
Don't get me wrong.


00:09:34.372 --> 00:09:36.840
I don't really want your money.


00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.076
I just wanna have fun
by seeing you guys suffer.


00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:06.166
Teppei...
He's a peon, but he's cunning.


00:10:07.973 --> 00:10:11.101
Ryota Fujii... He's just a coward.


00:10:15.614 --> 00:10:19.072
But the one I hate most
is the leader, Sho Kimura.


00:10:20.585 --> 00:10:23.019
It's morning! Wake...


00:10:24.089 --> 00:10:25.886
Oh, you got up early.


00:10:27.225 --> 00:10:31.753
We're having fried chicken for
breakfast. They're still hot and tasty.


00:10:31.863 --> 00:10:32.852
Hot!


00:10:34.666 --> 00:10:37.430
Hey, what happened to your face?


00:10:37.769 --> 00:10:38.793
I fell.


00:10:38.903 --> 00:10:40.734
That can't be.


00:10:42.607 --> 00:10:43.835
Come back here.


00:10:44.376 --> 00:10:47.072
Yu, tell me the truth.


00:10:47.278 --> 00:10:50.076
Okay, I got into
a fight and got pummeled.


00:10:50.181 --> 00:10:51.978
You weren't bullied?


00:10:52.083 --> 00:10:57.248
No, I'm not that hopeless. I hit
a classmate who pissed me off.


00:10:57.455 --> 00:10:58.615
Watch it.


00:10:58.723 --> 00:11:02.022
You've done it now.
I won't go easy on you.


00:11:02.894 --> 00:11:07.593
You shouldn't use violence like that.
Remember what Dad used to say?


00:11:08.266 --> 00:11:09.324
Jeez.


00:11:11.269 --> 00:11:15.103
Violence doesn't solve anything.
It only hurts people.


00:11:16.041 --> 00:11:20.273
You and I fully understand that.


00:11:27.719 --> 00:11:31.985
When Mom and Dad killed
themselves over murder allegations,


00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:33.887
we promised then.


00:11:34.893 --> 00:11:37.225
Not to lose loved ones.


00:11:38.096 --> 00:11:40.826
To always be there for each other.


00:11:42.267 --> 00:11:45.930
No matter what happens,
I'm going to protect you.


00:11:47.172 --> 00:11:48.400
Sis...


00:12:23.441 --> 00:12:25.705
Listen, Sho.


00:12:27.679 --> 00:12:33.618
Whatever you do, do not ever bring
shame to our Hanzo Hattori clan.


00:12:37.555 --> 00:12:39.284
I know, Dad.


00:12:39.824 --> 00:12:48.027
We may be yakuza now,
but never lose your ninja pride.


00:12:50.101 --> 00:12:52.296
Never let your guard down.


00:12:52.403 --> 00:12:53.427
Never!


00:13:00.378 --> 00:13:02.846
Everyone except
yourself is an enemy!


00:13:03.581 --> 00:13:05.640
Think of them as slaves, right?


00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.842
That's right!


00:13:07.819 --> 00:13:09.616
Do not fear blades.


00:13:09.754 --> 00:13:12.120
Use them to destroy your enemy!


00:13:12.223 --> 00:13:14.418
Destroy! Destroy!


00:13:17.262 --> 00:13:18.695
Very good.


00:13:19.631 --> 00:13:22.293
You are my flesh and blood.


00:13:25.737 --> 00:13:28.467
I will make our bond even greater.


00:13:33.244 --> 00:13:35.439
A cup of my own blood.


00:13:35.947 --> 00:13:39.246
Drink it to strengthen our bond.


00:13:41.319 --> 00:13:42.786
Drink it...


00:13:42.887 --> 00:13:45.447
Drink more...


00:13:46.524 --> 00:13:49.084
Drink it...


00:13:51.796 --> 00:13:53.195
Sho...


00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:59.000
As long as you're around,
our clan will never die.


00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.670
You are my treasure!


00:14:07.745 --> 00:14:10.213
Master, your breakfast is ready.


00:14:13.384 --> 00:14:14.373
Hey.


00:14:15.653 --> 00:14:17.848
You must be new.


00:14:19.224 --> 00:14:24.423
How dare you interrupt our sacred
ritual between father and son?


00:14:25.063 --> 00:14:26.360
You!


00:14:29.934 --> 00:14:32.368
Young master, have a good day.


00:14:37.742 --> 00:14:40.302
Good morning, Mom.
What are you doing?


00:14:40.411 --> 00:14:42.276
Oh, good morning.


00:14:42.814 --> 00:14:47.217
This maid's been messing
up a lot, so I'm punishing her.


00:14:47.552 --> 00:14:49.179
Have a nice day.


00:14:53.725 --> 00:14:55.625
Have a nice day!


00:14:59.831 --> 00:15:02.561
She was a terrible maid.


00:15:04.869 --> 00:15:06.131
Bye-bye.


00:15:11.709 --> 00:15:13.404
Have a nice day.


00:15:24.756 --> 00:15:28.089
Where are you going?
School's the other way.


00:15:28.559 --> 00:15:30.220
Where's the money?


00:15:32.664 --> 00:15:35.098
Wait! Come back!


00:15:37.235 --> 00:15:38.998
What the hell?


00:15:39.103 --> 00:15:41.298
Watch where you're going!


00:15:41.773 --> 00:15:45.436
Come here, you! Come on!


00:15:46.344 --> 00:15:47.504
You open?


00:15:47.612 --> 00:15:48.874
Hello.


00:15:50.915 --> 00:15:53.475
Excuse me! Is Takeshi here?


00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:57.888
Hey! Wait! Who are you?


00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:03.449
What's wrong with kids these days?
They don't even say hello.


00:16:03.861 --> 00:16:06.352
Miki, do you know that kid?


00:16:07.265 --> 00:16:08.391
Miki?


00:16:12.437 --> 00:16:14.302
What was that?


00:16:16.941 --> 00:16:20.104
I'm scared... I'm scared...


00:16:21.546 --> 00:16:24.709
Those guys are... It's me.
We're in trouble. Run for it.


00:16:24.816 --> 00:16:25.783
What should we do?


00:16:25.783 --> 00:16:28.411
What should we do?
What do you want with Takeshi?


00:16:28.519 --> 00:16:29.387
Sorry...


00:16:29.387 --> 00:16:30.388
Sorry...
Ma, this is my friend, Yu Hyuga.


00:16:30.388 --> 00:16:32.288
Ma, this is my friend, Yu Hyuga.


00:16:34.926 --> 00:16:39.454
You're the son of
those alleged murderers.


00:16:39.897 --> 00:16:43.458
That's not true! My dad
was framed and killed himself.


00:16:43.601 --> 00:16:45.398
I don't care.


00:16:46.537 --> 00:16:49.028
Just stay away from my son.


00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.573
Go home!


00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.668
Takeshi? Takeshi!


00:16:54.512 --> 00:16:56.912
Takeshi, where are you going?


00:16:57.015 --> 00:16:58.277
Takeshi!


00:17:00.518 --> 00:17:01.085
Ready?


00:17:01.085 --> 00:17:02.052
Ready?
Okay.


00:17:02.153 --> 00:17:03.415
Go for it!


00:17:05.356 --> 00:17:08.621
You're amazing!
Nice shot! Just as I expected!


00:17:09.193 --> 00:17:12.993
I'm jealous of you. Seeing you
and Yu get along like that.


00:17:13.097 --> 00:17:16.658
He seems like a nice kid.
He must be easy to deal with.


00:17:16.768 --> 00:17:18.633
That's not true.


00:17:18.736 --> 00:17:22.536
He's very selfish.
I don't know what to do with him.


00:17:25.376 --> 00:17:26.570
This is bad!


00:17:28.379 --> 00:17:30.074
Y-Yoshie, excuse me.


00:17:30.181 --> 00:17:32.115
W-Wait, Ami!


00:17:32.216 --> 00:17:34.810
Where are you going? Jeez...


00:17:43.928 --> 00:17:45.020
Hold it!


00:17:45.863 --> 00:17:47.728
Where do you think you're going?


00:17:47.832 --> 00:17:49.959
Stop running away, man!


00:18:00.745 --> 00:18:01.679
Sorry...


00:18:01.679 --> 00:18:02.805
Sorry...
Hey.


00:18:03.014 --> 00:18:04.481
Where to, girl?


00:18:04.582 --> 00:18:05.844
I'm in a rush.


00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:08.942
What's the rush?
Where are you going?


00:18:09.053 --> 00:18:10.418
Stop!


00:18:13.458 --> 00:18:15.483
Who do you think you are?


00:18:16.127 --> 00:18:18.527
No! No! Stop!


00:18:18.629 --> 00:18:19.596
No!


00:18:21.766 --> 00:18:23.063
Stop...


00:18:23.167 --> 00:18:25.465
No! Stop!


00:18:30.374 --> 00:18:32.308
What are you thinking?


00:18:32.443 --> 00:18:34.377
You broke your promise.


00:18:35.046 --> 00:18:39.244
Do you know how embarrassing
this is for a yakuza's son?


00:18:49.894 --> 00:18:51.293
Stop!


00:18:51.662 --> 00:18:53.254
Stop!


00:19:01.105 --> 00:19:04.074
Beating on you two isn't much fun.


00:19:04.642 --> 00:19:07.611
I think I want Yu's sister to be my toy.


00:19:08.079 --> 00:19:11.845
I hear she's got big tits,
and she's cute. Go find her.


00:19:15.486 --> 00:19:19.013
Don't you dare lay
a finger on my sister!


00:19:31.602 --> 00:19:34.935
You sissies. You pissed me off.


00:19:36.407 --> 00:19:38.875
I won't take it easy on you!


00:19:38.976 --> 00:19:40.967
What the hell?


00:19:54.859 --> 00:19:56.224
Yu!


00:20:16.981 --> 00:20:20.473
You're pretty strong.
Is your sister strong too?


00:20:20.651 --> 00:20:22.414
She's much stronger!


00:20:22.887 --> 00:20:25.082
Then she should've trained you better.


00:20:34.632 --> 00:20:35.894
Takeshi...


00:20:38.502 --> 00:20:39.628
Are you okay?


00:20:39.737 --> 00:20:41.432
Yu, I'm scared...


00:20:43.107 --> 00:20:44.438
Shut up!


00:20:48.179 --> 00:20:49.840
Takeshi!


00:20:50.615 --> 00:20:51.877
Takeshi!


00:21:00.625 --> 00:21:01.717
See ya.


00:21:15.706 --> 00:21:16.832
Sis...


00:21:22.413 --> 00:21:23.380
Yu?


00:21:32.823 --> 00:21:34.120
Yu...


00:21:35.626 --> 00:21:36.923
Yu!


00:22:04.655 --> 00:22:05.679
Yu...


00:22:06.724 --> 00:22:08.055
Yu...


00:22:08.993 --> 00:22:11.393
This is some kind of joke, right?


00:22:41.058 --> 00:22:41.692
<i>Sugihara Motors</i>


00:22:41.692 --> 00:22:44.024
<i>Sugihara Motors</i>


00:22:54.171 --> 00:22:55.468
Takeshi...


00:22:57.541 --> 00:22:59.907
Why did you have to go?


00:23:01.979 --> 00:23:03.139
Takeshi...


00:23:04.415 --> 00:23:05.382
Takeshi...


00:23:05.449 --> 00:23:06.250
Excuse me.


00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:07.808
Excuse me.
Takeshi...


00:23:20.831 --> 00:23:22.162
Who are you?


00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:24.991
I'm Yu's older sister.


00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:29.464
I'm so sorry about Takeshi...


00:23:30.508 --> 00:23:32.135
What do you want?


00:23:32.643 --> 00:23:35.840
The police are trying
to call it a suicide.


00:23:37.181 --> 00:23:41.311
But I know someone was
responsible for their deaths.


00:23:43.354 --> 00:23:45.083
If only I had a lead...


00:23:45.256 --> 00:23:46.416
Stop it.


00:23:47.391 --> 00:23:50.690
I don't want you playing the victim.


00:23:51.095 --> 00:23:52.153
Look.


00:23:52.963 --> 00:23:58.128
If it weren't for your brother,
Takeshi would still be alive!


00:23:59.403 --> 00:24:00.495
But...


00:24:01.138 --> 00:24:03.572
You people are murderers.


00:24:03.741 --> 00:24:06.733
Your family brings misfortune
to everyone around you!


00:24:06.811 --> 00:24:07.971
Stop it!


00:24:08.379 --> 00:24:09.812
Get out of here!


00:24:09.914 --> 00:24:11.108
Miki.


00:24:20.291 --> 00:24:28.062
Neither Yu, Dad, nor I
would ever kill anyone...


00:24:37.174 --> 00:24:39.904
There's no way Yu would kill himself.


00:24:41.946 --> 00:24:43.379
No way.


00:24:46.150 --> 00:24:48.880
Someone forced him into it.


00:24:50.287 --> 00:24:52.551
Someone must've killed him!


00:25:13.210 --> 00:25:15.804
"People I want to kill."


00:25:16.780 --> 00:25:18.213
What is this?


00:25:20.584 --> 00:25:23.075
Why didn't I find out sooner?


00:25:26.156 --> 00:25:27.282
Yu...


00:25:27.925 --> 00:25:29.290
I'm sorry!


00:25:55.619 --> 00:25:56.813
I'm sorry.


00:25:57.254 --> 00:26:01.190
I'm not sure about tempura
in the morning. Is it okay?


00:26:17.775 --> 00:26:21.802
The incident with your
brother breaks my heart.


00:26:21.912 --> 00:26:24.779
I'm sad since I was his friend.


00:26:27.084 --> 00:26:31.043
Ryota, who's the leader of the group?


00:26:33.123 --> 00:26:36.320
Ryota needs to get to school, so...


00:26:38.429 --> 00:26:39.453
Wait.


00:26:39.763 --> 00:26:42.789
Well, I'm going.
Make yourself at home.


00:26:44.168 --> 00:26:45.328
So...


00:26:47.071 --> 00:26:52.031
Are you saying that our
Ryota bullied your brother?


00:26:55.212 --> 00:26:57.180
This diary is proof.


00:26:58.115 --> 00:27:01.482
I'd like you to come to
the police precinct with me.


00:27:01.585 --> 00:27:03.280
You're an idiot!


00:27:04.722 --> 00:27:09.716
We've been in the police business
ever since my grandfather's time.


00:27:11.729 --> 00:27:13.697
You're Hyuga, right?


00:27:14.665 --> 00:27:18.032
I know that your father is a murderer.


00:27:19.803 --> 00:27:22.670
Trying to falsely accuse my son...


00:27:25.476 --> 00:27:27.444
What do you want?


00:27:28.278 --> 00:27:30.303
Murderer!


00:27:32.750 --> 00:27:33.808
What?


00:27:36.253 --> 00:27:39.689
If he was being bullied,


00:27:40.658 --> 00:27:44.458
maybe it was because something
was wrong with your brother.


00:27:44.561 --> 00:27:48.497
I don't want you blaming us
for your brother's problems.


00:27:52.670 --> 00:27:54.103
Please stop.


00:27:55.673 --> 00:27:57.698
I want to talk calmly.


00:27:57.808 --> 00:27:59.537
I can't talk to you.


00:27:59.943 --> 00:28:06.007
A minx like you should be arrested!


00:28:13.357 --> 00:28:16.793
Stop!
There's no need for this violence!


00:28:16.894 --> 00:28:20.489
I'm doing this to protect my son!


00:28:28.205 --> 00:28:29.365
Please stop!


00:29:00.270 --> 00:29:02.363
It's hot!


00:29:11.014 --> 00:29:14.211
Oh, it fried up very nicely.


00:29:14.485 --> 00:29:16.248
Such tasty tempura.


00:29:21.959 --> 00:29:24.826
Hot! Hot! Hot!


00:29:31.401 --> 00:29:33.096
Damn it!


00:29:33.470 --> 00:29:34.767
H-Honey!


00:29:37.407 --> 00:29:39.466
Honey, are you okay?


00:29:41.445 --> 00:29:43.572
Don't call the cops.


00:29:44.047 --> 00:29:48.108
I'll find her and finish her off!


00:29:57.094 --> 00:29:58.288
It stings...


00:29:58.395 --> 00:29:59.657
Oh, it stings...


00:29:59.763 --> 00:30:01.025
It stings.


00:30:01.498 --> 00:30:02.931
l-It stings...


00:30:03.033 --> 00:30:04.694
Ow...


00:30:05.002 --> 00:30:06.560
Ow...


00:30:30.360 --> 00:30:31.418
Stop.


00:30:31.995 --> 00:30:35.021
If you make a noise, I'll slit your throat.


00:30:35.132 --> 00:30:39.330
Now apologize to Yu
and tell me who your leader is.


00:30:39.436 --> 00:30:40.664
I don't know.


00:30:43.207 --> 00:30:48.144
I'll tell you. The leader is
a yakuza's son, Sho Kimura!


00:30:48.545 --> 00:30:50.513
Sho Kimura?


00:30:53.050 --> 00:30:56.076
I can't breathe... Murderer...


00:30:56.920 --> 00:31:00.549
I always believed that it was
wrong to kill no matter what.


00:31:01.391 --> 00:31:04.918
But I learned from your parents


00:31:06.296 --> 00:31:08.890
that there's a time and place for it!


00:31:20.677 --> 00:31:22.042
A blackout?


00:32:27.311 --> 00:32:29.438
Ryota!


00:32:59.076 --> 00:33:03.206
I hope you rot in hell together!


00:33:11.421 --> 00:33:15.084
Mother, there's
no conditioner. Can you get some?


00:33:16.460 --> 00:33:20.191
Sir, how about
an unusual conditioner?


00:33:22.099 --> 00:33:24.966
It can't be... you!


00:33:30.774 --> 00:33:34.540
Ryota!


00:33:34.644 --> 00:33:37.442
Wash your hair with your son's blood!


00:33:41.118 --> 00:33:43.643
Ryota!


00:33:48.458 --> 00:33:49.789
Ryota?


00:33:50.460 --> 00:33:52.928
Please, God!


00:33:57.367 --> 00:33:59.130
Serves you right.


00:34:10.614 --> 00:34:14.345
I'm a demon! I turned into a demon!


00:34:20.857 --> 00:34:25.385
I'll remain a demon until I kill
every last one of Yu's enemies!


00:34:35.338 --> 00:34:36.896
Delicious.


00:34:47.084 --> 00:34:49.109
Here are your noodles and soup...


00:34:49.219 --> 00:34:51.380
Hot!


00:34:51.655 --> 00:34:54.590
Hey! What do you think you're doing?


00:34:55.659 --> 00:34:58.253
What'll you do
about the master's leg?


00:34:58.361 --> 00:35:01.228
I don't like that look on your face!


00:35:03.967 --> 00:35:05.025
Hey!


00:35:08.171 --> 00:35:11.004
Keep it down.


00:35:22.652 --> 00:35:24.586
Sorry about that.


00:35:26.857 --> 00:35:29.951
You must be the new chef, right?


00:35:30.160 --> 00:35:31.286
Yes...


00:35:31.495 --> 00:35:33.190
Got kids?


00:35:33.296 --> 00:35:34.263
No.


00:35:37.734 --> 00:35:39.895
Kids are great.


00:35:41.071 --> 00:35:47.909
I did a lot of bad things in
my life, but my kids need me.


00:35:51.982 --> 00:35:54.644
Sho means everything to me.


00:35:55.685 --> 00:35:57.846
I live because of him.


00:35:59.923 --> 00:36:03.290
And you caused him great pain...


00:36:05.562 --> 00:36:08.622
Cut off a finger as an apology!


00:36:09.933 --> 00:36:11.525
Please forgive me!


00:36:15.906 --> 00:36:19.239
Honey, that's not right.


00:36:19.743 --> 00:36:22.268
You always do this.


00:36:23.180 --> 00:36:25.580
I'm really sorry about all this.


00:36:28.752 --> 00:36:30.344
You're too soft!


00:36:32.656 --> 00:36:38.060
Even all five fingers wouldn't
be enough to make it up to Sho!


00:36:39.629 --> 00:36:43.565
I am formerly of the Kanto Beasts!
Don't fuck with me!


00:36:44.935 --> 00:36:46.300
No!


00:36:46.736 --> 00:36:49.432
If you don't want to die,


00:36:51.007 --> 00:36:55.467
then at least apologize like
the true chef you are, huh?


00:37:02.919 --> 00:37:06.616
Excuse me. I want
to ask you for directions.


00:37:07.157 --> 00:37:09.125
Where do you need to go?


00:37:09.993 --> 00:37:11.654
Where's Sho Kimura?


00:37:12.395 --> 00:37:14.260
Take me to him!


00:37:17.234 --> 00:37:17.367
Now, eat some sushi...


00:37:17.367 --> 00:37:20.928
Now, eat some sushi...


00:37:22.505 --> 00:37:25.736
Eat as much as you want...


00:37:30.614 --> 00:37:32.775
Go ahead and eat.


00:37:35.285 --> 00:37:37.219
If you say so...


00:37:43.727 --> 00:37:46.855
How do your fingers taste?


00:37:50.367 --> 00:37:53.234
We need a new
chef starting tomorrow.


00:37:53.803 --> 00:37:55.862
I'm going to the bathroom.


00:38:21.898 --> 00:38:23.525
You're Sho Kimura?


00:38:24.167 --> 00:38:26.135
Who the hell are you?


00:38:26.236 --> 00:38:28.261
What was that sound?


00:38:28.438 --> 00:38:29.496
Sho!


00:38:30.607 --> 00:38:32.768
Who the hell are you?


00:38:33.076 --> 00:38:35.442
Stay back or I'll slit his throat.


00:38:35.545 --> 00:38:39.174
I'm not afraid to die.
I just want to kill him.


00:38:42.285 --> 00:38:45.049
No way. You can't kill me.


00:38:45.822 --> 00:38:47.016
What's that?


00:38:50.827 --> 00:38:52.886
You won't get away! Someone!


00:38:52.996 --> 00:38:54.156
Right!


00:39:09.379 --> 00:39:11.404
She's good.


00:39:49.419 --> 00:39:50.784
You...


00:39:51.988 --> 00:39:54.047
You killed my Yu!


00:40:00.764 --> 00:40:01.890
Go through!


00:40:14.944 --> 00:40:20.644
You did pretty good for a girl.


00:40:22.519 --> 00:40:24.646
But it's over now.


00:40:25.488 --> 00:40:28.946
I'm sure you know what's
going to happen to you, right?


00:40:50.580 --> 00:40:53.947
Yu's sister, I feel sorry for you.


00:40:54.217 --> 00:40:56.048
You were so close.


00:40:56.853 --> 00:41:01.381
Wounds from burns and a katana.
Your arm is a mess, girl.


00:41:03.560 --> 00:41:08.725
We, the Hattori clan, won't kill
our enemy after they're captured.


00:41:10.767 --> 00:41:15.932
We give them a taste
of hell before killing them.


00:41:17.407 --> 00:41:23.073
I thought your stupid
son was the crazy one,


00:41:25.415 --> 00:41:29.749
but you're all insane!


00:41:32.889 --> 00:41:36.256
You have pretty fingers...


00:41:38.628 --> 00:41:43.292
I can't believe these belong
to such a strong girl like you...


00:41:44.534 --> 00:41:49.801
Slice, slice, slice these fingers off...


00:41:51.207 --> 00:41:53.675
O great Hanzo Hattori.


00:41:53.776 --> 00:41:58.236
Provide this girl with
great pain and suffering.


00:42:06.089 --> 00:42:07.920
It hurts!


00:42:12.795 --> 00:42:17.255
That was for all three of us.


00:42:19.168 --> 00:42:21.500
But we're not done yet.


00:42:23.139 --> 00:42:26.836
Now this is from the great Hanzo!


00:42:37.153 --> 00:42:40.645
It looks pretty nice without any fingers.


00:42:43.893 --> 00:42:46.862
I think that's enough for today.


00:42:47.030 --> 00:42:48.622
One minute.


00:42:49.566 --> 00:42:50.760
Wait.


00:42:52.035 --> 00:42:54.595
You should keep going, honey!


00:42:54.704 --> 00:42:59.505
Torture isn't fun unless
you do it a little bit at a time.


00:43:00.209 --> 00:43:04.669
That's why you're too soft.
You should finish her off at once!


00:43:04.781 --> 00:43:07.272
You shut up and let me do my job!


00:43:47.724 --> 00:43:50.192
I'm gonna give you a painkiller.


00:43:50.727 --> 00:43:52.718
The boss is being kind.


00:43:53.830 --> 00:43:58.392
It's a shame you're
gonna be hacked up tomorrow.


00:44:00.870 --> 00:44:03.771
Such a nice body.


00:44:07.076 --> 00:44:10.807
Give me the key
to unlock this chain! Now!


00:44:18.521 --> 00:44:20.614
What is this?


00:44:21.257 --> 00:44:23.691
Shit. She escaped.


00:44:24.861 --> 00:44:27.125
Hey! Someone!


00:44:29.032 --> 00:44:30.431
What's wrong?


00:44:30.533 --> 00:44:31.864
That girl...


00:44:35.905 --> 00:44:39.397
That bitch... Where did she go?


00:44:43.579 --> 00:44:46.377
Like I said,
you were too easy on her!


00:44:47.884 --> 00:44:52.218
Find her and kill her.


00:45:30.359 --> 00:45:31.417
Yu...


00:45:32.595 --> 00:45:35.063
Where are you taking me?


00:46:04.627 --> 00:46:06.151
Don't overdo it.


00:46:06.262 --> 00:46:10.198
You won't be able to work
efficiently even if you work overtime.


00:46:10.299 --> 00:46:11.234
I'll take over.


00:46:11.234 --> 00:46:12.724
I'll take over.
Don't.


00:46:14.370 --> 00:46:16.565
I want to keep working.


00:46:18.241 --> 00:46:23.304
If I stop working for even a bit,
I start to think about Takeshi.


00:46:24.313 --> 00:46:25.541
I see...


00:46:36.125 --> 00:46:37.490
Hey, Miki!


00:46:37.593 --> 00:46:39.618
Someone's collapsed outside!


00:46:39.729 --> 00:46:41.697
Hey! Are you okay?


00:46:41.798 --> 00:46:44.232
Hey! Hey! Hey!


00:46:45.968 --> 00:46:47.333
Hey, Miki...


00:46:47.837 --> 00:46:49.771
Are you okay? Hey!


00:46:51.040 --> 00:46:51.274
Hey!


00:46:51.274 --> 00:46:53.174
Hey!
This girl...


00:47:06.522 --> 00:47:09.719
Are you sure you
know what you're doing?


00:47:10.760 --> 00:47:13.194
Yeah. Don't worry.


00:47:14.297 --> 00:47:16.629
I'm the son of a doctor.


00:47:18.201 --> 00:47:23.571
When I was in the biker gang, I fixed
up buddies who got hurt in fights.


00:47:25.141 --> 00:47:26.540
Including you.


00:47:28.144 --> 00:47:32.706
Hey, you're going to throw her
out when she wakes up, right?


00:47:33.216 --> 00:47:36.208
I don't want to get
dragged into anything.


00:47:37.987 --> 00:47:40.888
Even if it has something
to do with Takeshi's death?


00:47:42.091 --> 00:47:45.754
I'm sure she's like this
because she discovered the truth.


00:47:46.629 --> 00:47:48.893
It's not safe for her out there.


00:47:48.998 --> 00:47:51.865
So you want to keep her here?


00:47:52.935 --> 00:47:54.197
No way.


00:47:56.739 --> 00:47:59.207
You have nothing against her, right?


00:48:03.312 --> 00:48:05.143
Hey, are you okay?


00:48:14.056 --> 00:48:15.353
You...


00:48:26.168 --> 00:48:27.533
I'm home.


00:48:38.714 --> 00:48:41.774
No! Who are you people?


00:48:41.884 --> 00:48:43.749
No! Get off of me!


00:48:51.661 --> 00:48:53.891
Sorry to barge in.


00:48:55.831 --> 00:49:00.859
We hear that you're
best friends with Ami Hyuga.


00:49:03.039 --> 00:49:07.135
Is she here?


00:49:08.144 --> 00:49:12.604
I don't know what you're
talking about. She's not here!


00:49:13.983 --> 00:49:16.543
I'm not involved with anything!


00:49:19.155 --> 00:49:21.419
I don't know any Ami.


00:49:22.291 --> 00:49:24.054
I don't know her!


00:49:24.160 --> 00:49:25.923
I see.


00:49:27.163 --> 00:49:29.324
I apologize then.


00:49:30.700 --> 00:49:33.464
She wasn't here after all, huh?


00:49:33.703 --> 00:49:38.140
Then we have to keep
you quiet about all this.


00:49:56.559 --> 00:50:02.054
Hey, why don't you do it with her?


00:50:02.631 --> 00:50:03.598
Right.


00:50:03.699 --> 00:50:08.102
It's not often that
you get to do a college girl.


00:50:14.010 --> 00:50:16.740
Where the hell did she go?


00:50:36.532 --> 00:50:39.831
You can eat a rice ball
with one hand, right? Here.


00:50:43.773 --> 00:50:46.537
So what you told us is true?


00:50:47.443 --> 00:50:50.105
Takeshi was killed by a yakuza's son?


00:50:50.212 --> 00:50:52.840
I wouldn't have lost
my arm if it weren't true.


00:50:52.948 --> 00:50:55.883
Who and where is he? Tell me!


00:50:55.985 --> 00:51:00.820
Shut up. I thought you didn't want
to have anything to do with me.


00:51:01.023 --> 00:51:04.550
Is that how you talk
to people who saved your life?


00:51:05.895 --> 00:51:09.831
You told me once
not to play the victim.


00:51:10.466 --> 00:51:12.991
Well, right back at you!


00:51:24.547 --> 00:51:26.242
Now you did it.


00:51:26.816 --> 00:51:31.549
I don't give a damn
if you only have one arm!


00:51:39.395 --> 00:51:42.091
Hey... What are you doing, Miki?


00:51:42.198 --> 00:51:44.428
She hasn't recovered yet.


00:51:44.533 --> 00:51:46.330
Please don't stop us.


00:51:46.969 --> 00:51:51.201
No matter what shape I'm in,
I just want to settle this.


00:51:52.675 --> 00:51:55.940
It's a battle between those
who've lost loved ones.


00:52:17.500 --> 00:52:19.695
The loser will be covered in blood.


00:52:23.873 --> 00:52:25.500
I can't lose.


00:52:26.408 --> 00:52:33.439
No matter what happens to my body,
I have to seek revenge for Yu's sake!


00:52:33.782 --> 00:52:35.147
Me too.


00:52:36.352 --> 00:52:40.846
I'm furious with myself for not
being able to protect Takeshi!


00:52:54.370 --> 00:52:55.337
Ow!


00:52:58.707 --> 00:53:00.140
Are you okay?


00:53:01.577 --> 00:53:06.640
Ami, you're pretty good
even if you only have one arm.


00:53:08.984 --> 00:53:11.919
You came at me
with everything you had.


00:53:12.388 --> 00:53:13.821
I like that.


00:53:15.024 --> 00:53:19.518
Mind if I join you
in getting your revenge?


00:53:20.296 --> 00:53:22.594
You'll be with a murderer.


00:53:22.865 --> 00:53:24.196
Are you sure?


00:53:24.767 --> 00:53:26.758
They're my enemies too.


00:53:27.269 --> 00:53:31.228
Besides, if there's a way to get
revenge by not killing people,


00:53:31.340 --> 00:53:33.638
then I'd like to know it.


00:53:34.710 --> 00:53:37.372
It's kill, kill, kill.


00:53:51.393 --> 00:53:55.022
Ami, it must be hard
to fight with that kind of body.


00:53:55.898 --> 00:53:58.093
I'll make you a new arm.


00:53:58.467 --> 00:54:00.492
One made of steel.


00:54:38.173 --> 00:54:41.165
You think you can
avenge your brother like that?


00:54:41.277 --> 00:54:44.474
He won't be able
to rest in peace, you idiot!


00:54:51.453 --> 00:54:52.087
It's tough!


00:54:52.087 --> 00:54:54.647
It's tough!
This training is for moving forward!


00:54:54.757 --> 00:54:57.317
You didn't even move a millimeter.


00:54:57.993 --> 00:54:59.756
Come on! Keep going!


00:55:21.550 --> 00:55:23.040
Cute face.


00:55:23.619 --> 00:55:25.814
Those are the eyes. Remember that!


00:55:39.034 --> 00:55:40.831
Can I help you?


00:55:42.738 --> 00:55:45.434
The Kimuras moved away recently.


00:55:46.408 --> 00:55:47.242
Where?


00:55:47.242 --> 00:55:49.574
Where?
How should I know?


00:55:49.712 --> 00:55:52.510
But I'm glad the yakuza are gone.


00:55:53.282 --> 00:55:54.374
Thank you.


00:56:17.139 --> 00:56:18.265
Suguru?


00:56:19.174 --> 00:56:20.539
Oh, Ami.


00:56:22.010 --> 00:56:23.534
I'm almost done.


00:56:24.613 --> 00:56:27.275
Thank you... for everything.


00:56:29.251 --> 00:56:32.311
I hope you'll stay friends with my wife.


00:56:34.690 --> 00:56:37.887
She can't have any more kids.


00:56:39.828 --> 00:56:44.094
I wasn't able to understand her pain.


00:56:45.734 --> 00:56:46.894
But, Ami...


00:56:47.636 --> 00:56:51.072
She was saved by meeting you.


00:56:52.841 --> 00:56:55.833
So please take good care of her.


00:56:58.013 --> 00:56:59.139
I will.


00:57:01.049 --> 00:57:03.347
Ami! We have a problem!


00:57:03.752 --> 00:57:05.481
The Kimura family's gone.


00:57:05.554 --> 00:57:06.521
What?


00:57:06.622 --> 00:57:08.556
They're up to something.


00:57:08.657 --> 00:57:11.455
Hey, do you hear a strange noise?


00:57:25.741 --> 00:57:27.075
The machine gun...


00:57:27.075 --> 00:57:28.372
The machine gun...
Okay!


00:57:33.335 --> 00:57:36.634
All right, calm down... Calm down...


00:57:42.778 --> 00:57:43.802
We are


00:57:47.616 --> 00:57:50.608
the Junior High Shuriken Gang!


00:58:00.362 --> 00:58:01.420
Whoa.


00:58:02.231 --> 00:58:05.029
Takeshi's house is really dirty.


00:58:07.770 --> 00:58:12.036
Excuse me, but could
you stop wandering around?


00:58:13.075 --> 00:58:15.908
Your family members
died on their own,


00:58:16.011 --> 00:58:18.377
so don't hold a grudge against us.


00:58:18.481 --> 00:58:20.711
Honestly, it's disturbing.


00:58:21.450 --> 00:58:25.216
I'm going to kill that bastard!


00:58:26.188 --> 00:58:28.452
You stupid brat.


00:58:29.925 --> 00:58:31.552
You're gonna get it!


00:59:10.099 --> 00:59:12.363
We might get killed first!


00:59:26.816 --> 00:59:27.783
The wire...


00:59:30.553 --> 00:59:33.522
Honey, is that
machine gun finished yet?


00:59:34.223 --> 00:59:37.090
Hang on! I just have
to attach the trigger!


01:00:12.761 --> 01:00:15.855
Aw, looks like it's over now.


01:00:18.267 --> 01:00:19.928
Damn it...


01:00:24.740 --> 01:00:27.675
It went in! Yes! It's done!


01:00:30.613 --> 01:00:32.240
I'm finished...


01:00:37.553 --> 01:00:39.646
Ami! Take it!


01:01:28.370 --> 01:01:30.201
Honey!


01:01:31.473 --> 01:01:33.236
Honey! Honey!


01:02:11.246 --> 01:02:12.713
Shit...


01:02:12.781 --> 01:02:14.305
She's pretty good...


01:02:22.524 --> 01:02:23.684
I'm hit!


01:02:35.371 --> 01:02:37.839
Mommy...


01:02:37.973 --> 01:02:40.032
Mommy...


01:03:07.536 --> 01:03:10.664
Honey! Honey...


01:03:13.008 --> 01:03:14.600
Honey...


01:03:15.277 --> 01:03:17.211
No!


01:03:18.747 --> 01:03:22.410
Honey! Honey!


01:03:25.087 --> 01:03:26.384
Honey...


01:03:26.488 --> 01:03:28.149
Suguru...


01:03:36.432 --> 01:03:39.367
Takashi! Takashi! Takashi!


01:03:48.310 --> 01:03:52.770
Damn it... Who killed my son?


01:03:57.152 --> 01:04:01.145
I'll never forgive... Who killed him?


01:04:02.691 --> 01:04:05.057
I'm sorry about your loss.


01:04:09.231 --> 01:04:12.223
I know who killed your sons.


01:04:14.369 --> 01:04:17.202
Do you want me to help you?


01:04:46.869 --> 01:04:49.167
There's no point hiding here.


01:04:49.938 --> 01:04:55.535
My boss will find you two
and send out an assassin.


01:04:58.814 --> 01:05:00.805
I'm not running away.


01:05:01.250 --> 01:05:03.810
I'm just waiting for
my chance for revenge.


01:05:06.488 --> 01:05:10.618
Stop bluffing and
give me something to eat.


01:05:11.093 --> 01:05:15.689
I'm hungry. I'm really hungry.


01:05:16.765 --> 01:05:20.565
If I kill you, then I won't know
where to find the Kimuras.


01:05:20.669 --> 01:05:23.467
So I'll let you live for now!


01:05:23.639 --> 01:05:25.504
Here's a rice ball.


01:05:26.241 --> 01:05:27.469
Eat it.


01:05:28.911 --> 01:05:30.242
Come on.


01:05:35.851 --> 01:05:36.875
Thanks.


01:05:38.187 --> 01:05:42.180
But that kindness
happens to be your weakness.


01:05:49.264 --> 01:05:52.097
Thank you for coming.


01:05:55.037 --> 01:06:01.465
I know that you have all lost
your children for no good reason.


01:06:04.446 --> 01:06:08.644
Your enemies will surely come here.


01:06:10.752 --> 01:06:16.019
I want to help you get your revenge!


01:06:19.561 --> 01:06:22.860
We're going to kill those women!


01:06:27.903 --> 01:06:29.837
Ryota!


01:06:37.145 --> 01:06:38.510
Damn...


01:06:39.681 --> 01:06:42.775
I can't believe I screwed up...


01:06:48.090 --> 01:06:49.114
Ami.


01:06:49.458 --> 01:06:52.359
Did you find out
where the Kimuras are?


01:06:53.629 --> 01:06:55.824
I really want to kill them.


01:06:58.734 --> 01:06:59.758
Miki?


01:07:01.270 --> 01:07:03.465
Miki, let me take a look.


01:07:03.872 --> 01:07:04.861
No...


01:07:06.775 --> 01:07:08.572
It looks bad...


01:07:10.879 --> 01:07:13.404
Her wound is getting infected.


01:07:13.982 --> 01:07:17.383
She'll die if you don't
get her to a hospital.


01:07:19.288 --> 01:07:22.553
Miki... You can't fight like this.


01:07:23.358 --> 01:07:27.021
Let's go to the nearest
hospital to get you fixed up.


01:07:27.529 --> 01:07:29.190
Wait a minute...


01:07:29.498 --> 01:07:33.298
You want to go without me?
You've gotta be kidding me.


01:07:34.903 --> 01:07:38.634
I can't just relax without
getting my revenge!


01:07:39.074 --> 01:07:40.166
No!


01:07:43.312 --> 01:07:44.643
Miki?


01:07:46.214 --> 01:07:47.738
I...


01:07:49.151 --> 01:07:51.711
I don't want you to die.


01:07:54.289 --> 01:07:58.521
I'll be the one to die
after getting our revenge.


01:08:06.368 --> 01:08:09.235
So I don't want you to die.


01:08:11.807 --> 01:08:14.469
I lost everyone I loved.


01:08:16.478 --> 01:08:19.072
I have no more hope left.


01:08:21.083 --> 01:08:24.314
But after I met you,


01:08:24.953 --> 01:08:29.356
I was able to understand
what it's like to protect someone.


01:08:31.460 --> 01:08:32.620
Miki.


01:08:34.229 --> 01:08:38.893
You're the only one who
means something to me now.


01:08:44.473 --> 01:08:47.067
Thanks, Ami.


01:08:49.010 --> 01:08:51.911
But I lost my husband and Takeshi.


01:08:53.548 --> 01:08:55.709
I'm as good as dead.


01:08:58.120 --> 01:09:04.548
If I don't crush the Kimuras,
then they'll never rest in peace.


01:09:08.296 --> 01:09:09.627
Ami...


01:09:15.070 --> 01:09:18.665
Ami, I'm begging you.


01:09:21.910 --> 01:09:27.177
Please let me die in peace.


01:09:31.153 --> 01:09:32.518
Miki...


01:09:37.392 --> 01:09:38.518
Come on.


01:09:39.161 --> 01:09:41.356
We don't have much time.


01:09:41.963 --> 01:09:44.523
Tell me where the Kimuras are hiding.


01:09:47.769 --> 01:09:51.762
I'm not going to tell you
even if you bash my head in!


01:09:51.873 --> 01:09:53.067
I see.


01:09:57.512 --> 01:10:00.140
Hey, what are you doing?


01:10:00.515 --> 01:10:02.483
Stop messing around...


01:10:04.052 --> 01:10:06.111
Stop! Stop!


01:10:06.521 --> 01:10:07.852
Stop it...


01:10:10.492 --> 01:10:12.722
You nailed me!


01:10:13.128 --> 01:10:15.187
Using a nail isn't fair!


01:10:15.297 --> 01:10:17.458
Stop complaining.


01:10:19.000 --> 01:10:21.969
We're risking our lives, you know!


01:10:24.806 --> 01:10:27.138
Miki, let's go.


01:10:28.176 --> 01:10:31.976
Let's go on a journey to hell
in order to kill the Kimuras!


01:10:35.584 --> 01:10:40.612
It's time to get your revenge.


01:11:43.952 --> 01:11:46.978
This is too much! No more!


01:11:48.123 --> 01:11:53.755
The Kimuras have
a hideout at Ichinooka Shrine.


01:11:54.729 --> 01:11:56.697
Ichinooka Shrine?


01:12:10.478 --> 01:12:13.174
This is the way
to Ichinooka Shrine, right?


01:12:13.281 --> 01:12:18.241
Ami, if you can't use your machine
gun, use the weapons in this bag.


01:12:19.588 --> 01:12:22.386
We're running short
on machine-gun bullets.


01:12:22.490 --> 01:12:24.287
You can use...


01:12:25.427 --> 01:12:26.416
This.


01:12:26.795 --> 01:12:29.263
This bullet is very powerful.


01:12:30.065 --> 01:12:32.431
It's nothing like the other ones.


01:12:33.168 --> 01:12:35.796
Use it to finish your opponent.


01:12:35.971 --> 01:12:40.431
It's got too much power and might
just destroy your machine gun.


01:12:42.477 --> 01:12:45.640
Think of it as
a last present from Suguru.


01:12:46.581 --> 01:12:47.639
Okay.


01:12:51.219 --> 01:12:56.555
Even with a weapon like that,
the two of you are gonna get killed.


01:12:58.159 --> 01:13:01.822
But it's impressive that
you got the boss all fired up.


01:13:02.931 --> 01:13:04.523
Shut up.


01:13:07.068 --> 01:13:08.558
Come on, Ami.


01:13:10.472 --> 01:13:11.598
Let's go!


01:13:52.614 --> 01:13:55.082
What? You actually came?


01:13:55.817 --> 01:13:57.842
My parents are angry.


01:13:58.086 --> 01:14:01.647
Why don't you just die
before you complicate things?


01:14:04.359 --> 01:14:06.327
What? You little punk!


01:14:08.196 --> 01:14:10.858
Huh? What's this?


01:14:43.832 --> 01:14:45.356
Ryota...


01:14:45.467 --> 01:14:47.697
Tomokazu...


01:14:48.236 --> 01:14:49.999
Takashi...


01:14:50.905 --> 01:14:51.872
Yoshio...


01:14:51.940 --> 01:14:52.998
Ryota...


01:14:53.108 --> 01:14:54.769
Tomokazu...


01:14:55.643 --> 01:14:57.167
Takashi...


01:15:09.023 --> 01:15:11.924
I'll give you credit for coming this far.


01:15:13.027 --> 01:15:17.191
I'll do whatever
it takes to protect our son!


01:15:19.234 --> 01:15:25.901
You're not the only ones who can
become demons for your families.


01:15:27.609 --> 01:15:29.236
Listen!


01:15:32.447 --> 01:15:40.752
We have gathered to punish
you for our sons' deaths.


01:15:41.623 --> 01:15:44.820
We're the Super Mourner Gang!


01:15:47.295 --> 01:15:51.391
Shit... You bastards...


01:15:52.600 --> 01:15:55.535
Feel the wrath of my son!


01:16:11.052 --> 01:16:12.041
Ami!


01:16:38.646 --> 01:16:41.740
You killed my son!


01:16:42.183 --> 01:16:43.445
Give him back!


01:16:48.523 --> 01:16:52.084
No way.
Bulletproof vests under the pictures...


01:17:45.914 --> 01:17:46.972
Takashi!


01:18:02.163 --> 01:18:04.290
Tomokazu! I'm sorry!


01:18:37.165 --> 01:18:38.496
I'm out of bullets.


01:19:05.660 --> 01:19:07.628
Wrong target.


01:19:11.032 --> 01:19:13.000
Thanks for waiting, Ami.


01:19:14.635 --> 01:19:17.331
Do you think you can kill me?


01:19:17.972 --> 01:19:20.941
My most deadly ninja weapon.


01:19:21.409 --> 01:19:23.969
The executioner's blade. Take this!


01:20:23.071 --> 01:20:24.538
Takashi...


01:20:27.975 --> 01:20:29.067
Ami.


01:20:43.825 --> 01:20:45.850
Here we go! Take this!


01:21:18.860 --> 01:21:20.020
Miki!


01:21:21.696 --> 01:21:23.027
Miki!


01:21:29.937 --> 01:21:31.063
Ami...


01:21:31.973 --> 01:21:33.998
Don't worry about me...


01:21:34.242 --> 01:21:36.073
Kill the Kimuras.


01:21:36.677 --> 01:21:40.738
You have to kill them for me!


01:21:48.523 --> 01:21:51.788
I've chopped off such a useless thing.


01:21:54.028 --> 01:21:57.122
In a matter of minutes, you will die.


01:21:57.431 --> 01:22:01.367
Then you won't be able
to hold a grudge against me.


01:22:02.003 --> 01:22:04.995
But if you still want to kill me,


01:22:05.940 --> 01:22:08.033
then come this way!


01:22:12.079 --> 01:22:14.707
How dare you do this to Miki...


01:22:16.184 --> 01:22:17.276
Miki...


01:22:19.654 --> 01:22:21.087
Go...


01:22:39.440 --> 01:22:43.467
Die in front of our great Hanzo's spirit!


01:23:01.128 --> 01:23:03.323
You will perish.


01:23:04.732 --> 01:23:07.929
Apologize to the great
Hanzo in the afterlife!


01:23:22.350 --> 01:23:23.840
Sho...


01:23:25.720 --> 01:23:29.121
I couldn't protect you...


01:23:35.263 --> 01:23:38.926
Take that, you brutal yakuza.


01:23:42.903 --> 01:23:44.530
Ami... Ami...


01:23:45.139 --> 01:23:48.472
l-I... I'm coming...


01:23:48.542 --> 01:23:50.874
You're not going anywhere!


01:24:18.372 --> 01:24:20.533
Ryota!


01:24:22.643 --> 01:24:24.440
Ryota!


01:24:38.292 --> 01:24:40.283
Ami!


01:24:43.998 --> 01:24:46.728
Don't let them beat you!


01:25:11.625 --> 01:25:12.717
Miki...


01:25:18.999 --> 01:25:23.026
Miki, I wish I could join you...


01:25:24.438 --> 01:25:27.703
But I want you to wait for me...


01:25:28.476 --> 01:25:30.706
Sho Kimura's still in the main hall...


01:25:32.046 --> 01:25:37.484
I can't die until I take his head.


01:25:52.733 --> 01:25:55.497
Missy, I'm over here.


01:25:55.603 --> 01:25:58.367
l-I'm scared... I'm scared...


01:26:01.909 --> 01:26:04.469
I'm using these three as my shield.


01:26:04.578 --> 01:26:08.275
If you want to kill me, go ahead.
But they're going to die too.


01:26:10.651 --> 01:26:12.619
You're such a coward.


01:26:18.159 --> 01:26:23.358
A ninja does whatever
it takes to survive.


01:26:25.699 --> 01:26:30.932
Sho is much more of
a ninja than his father was.


01:26:33.174 --> 01:26:35.904
That's because I raised him right.


01:26:37.478 --> 01:26:39.207
You stupid bitch.


01:26:40.581 --> 01:26:45.075
A person without love
can't possibly love their child!


01:27:09.777 --> 01:27:12.837
No way...
The chainsaw was deflected?


01:27:13.514 --> 01:27:14.947
I'm sorry.


01:27:15.316 --> 01:27:18.251
I'm wearing a special bra.


01:27:19.453 --> 01:27:21.216
A steel one.


01:27:21.322 --> 01:27:22.619
A drill bra.


01:27:25.526 --> 01:27:27.153
It can't be...


01:27:27.328 --> 01:27:30.263
Yes, it can be.


01:27:34.835 --> 01:27:37.303
What do you think of it?


01:27:45.813 --> 01:27:47.144
Enjoy my drill.


01:28:04.565 --> 01:28:05.793
Well?


01:28:24.151 --> 01:28:25.243
Well?


01:28:25.753 --> 01:28:28.221
How do you like my drill bra?


01:28:33.327 --> 01:28:36.160
Now I'll drill your face.


01:28:50.144 --> 01:28:52.078
I'm scared... I'm scared...


01:29:32.086 --> 01:29:33.144
Mom!


01:29:33.387 --> 01:29:34.445
Sho!


01:29:37.758 --> 01:29:39.282
Are you okay?


01:29:43.731 --> 01:29:46.564
This is for the ones you killed!


01:30:09.823 --> 01:30:12.792
Your love turned out to be harmful...


01:30:12.893 --> 01:30:15.691
I hope you both rot in hell!


01:30:27.975 --> 01:30:32.742
Listen up. Go down
the mountain and get some help.


01:30:33.914 --> 01:30:38.647
Find the police and tell them
that lots of people have been killed,


01:30:39.019 --> 01:30:41.852
and that a girl named Ami Hyuga did it.


01:30:42.556 --> 01:30:43.818
Go on.


01:30:44.558 --> 01:30:47.652
Even if you get bullied,
don't let them win.


01:30:47.961 --> 01:30:49.053
Promise?


01:30:49.763 --> 01:30:53.995
Yeah, I'll be strong like you one day.


01:31:10.684 --> 01:31:12.914
It's over, Yu.


01:31:14.555 --> 01:31:16.580
I'm such a stupid sister.


01:31:17.224 --> 01:31:20.682
You probably have nothing
but contempt for me now.


01:31:34.575 --> 01:31:36.007
Yu...

